    "sub_name": "觀光日語",
    "sub_ename": "JAPANESE FOR  TOURISM",
    "describe_ch": "不論是自行前往日本觀光旅遊，或是接待來台觀光的日本人，本課程的學習對兩者都非常有幫助，尤其是極力發展觀光的台灣，上了本課程，對學生的就業非常有利。",
    "describe_eh": "Be it for traveling independently to Japan or hosting Japanese visitors in Taiwan, this course will prove to be equally useful. With the tourism industry having been greatly promoted in Taiwan nowadays, students will benefit much from this course in their future career.",
